# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/paste-claims — add and open a claim per pasted line of name,amount,date,note, in order,
# for the named person on the sheet; a line matching a DRAFT of theirs (date and note) edits it to the line's amount
# and opens it instead. Body: { "text": "..." }. Any refused line (by the claim form's rules, or as the open button
# refuses) refuses the whole paste: nothing is stored or audited. Responds { "added": n }, the lines that went through.
# A note ending in " #<ref>" gives the claim that reference; a reference repeated on the sheet or in the paste
# (ignoring case) refuses the whole paste.
